 & =\\frac{6}{{x}^{3}}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNext, we solve ${f}^{″}(x)=0:$ \n\n$$\n\\frac{6}{{x}^{3}}=0\n$$\n\nThe equation above has no real solutions, so there are no points of inflection." "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14070683/state.json" "file_sha256" "a6e33a44bcbe3259e2679c784c8e9e566efcbd1da06c3ccd0ba85d0cbcdd545d"} {"question" "q-21035" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/hard "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14070683/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "2f8b8d8b2405723c2f603029d31a3d29a1b167dfb079504c8943f479686dcc2f"} {"question" "q-21035" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14070683/state.json" "file_sha256" "a6e33a44bcbe3259e2679c784c8e9e566efcbd1da06c3ccd0ba85d0cbcdd545d"} {"question" "q-21035" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "x=-4"] ["math" "x=2"] ["math" "x=3"] ["math" "x=4"] ["text" "There are no points of inflection"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14070683/state.json" "file_sha256" "a6e33a44bcbe3259e2679c784c8e9e566efcbd1da06c3ccd0ba85d0cbcdd545d"} {"question" "q-21035" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/text "There are no points of inflection"] "category" "model_interpretation" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14070683/state.json" "file_sha256" "a6e33a44bcbe3259e2679c784c8e9e566efcbd1da06c3ccd0ba85d0cbcdd545d"} {"question" "q-79200" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "![](/h